3130 0 obj
  << /ActualText (As a Product Designer\054 I leverage over a decade of design experience creating technology\055driven solutions that solve complex problems and add value for my customers\056 I specialize in developing innovative products that leverage systems\054 design patterns\054 AI\054 and machine learning\056\n\nCurrently\054 as the Lead Senior Product Designer for The Switch Is On\054 I work with the Building Decarbonization Coalition \050BDC\051 to eliminate natural gas from residential and commercial homes\054 aiming to reduce 35\045 of total US greenhouse gas emissions\056 My role involves creating simple and intuitive ways for customers to connect with decarbonization solutions\072 think of us as the middle\055men\056\n\nDriven by a need to make an impact\054 I aspire to create work that simplifies and enhances people\031s lives\056 My curiosity spans the commercial space\054 sustainable real estate\054 and healthcare sectors\056 I aim to lead teams that develop both digital and analog solutions\054 merging technology with human\055centered design to address real\055world problems\056)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 3131 0 R
     /Pg 3116 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

